  "id": "emotional-cognition",
  "term": "emotional cognition",
  "definition": "Emotional cognition is the mental ability to understand emotions, including recognizing emotional signals such as facial expressions. In children, it is reflected in how well they identify others’ emotions and use that information in social interaction and adaptation.",
